Modifications by the Franken Surveillance System project (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
the ONNX graph and its F32 initializers were converted offline, without numeric change,
into FSS Model IR v1 and a Safetensors file. Structural changes: x*Sigmoid(x) pairs are
expressed as the IR SiLU operator; nearest-neighbour Resize is expressed as an exact
Reshape/Concat composition; an RGB-to-BGR channel reorder was prepended; and the YOLOX
grid decode (grid offset, exp(wh) times stride) was appended as a second graph output.
The unmodified upstream head remains available as the "raw_head" output.
